{
  "info": {
    "name": "ATS CV Analyzer API",
    "description": "API pour analyser des CVs contre des offres d'emploi",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
        "header": []
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Scan CV",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('Response has analysis', function () {",
              "    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('analysis');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.analysis).to.have.property('global_score');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.analysis).to.have.property('matched_skills');",
              "    pm.expect(jsonData.analysis).to.have.property('missing_skills');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/scan",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": []
            },
            {
              "key": "job_offer",
              "value": "## Développeur Full Stack\n\n### Compétences requises\n- Python\n- JavaScript\n- React\n- Node.js\n- PostgreSQL\n- Git\n- Docker\n\n### Missions\n- Développement d'applications web\n- Maintenance du code existant\n- Participation aux revues de code\n- Travail en équipe Agile",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Scan CV - Exemple avec erreur",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status code is 400 for invalid file', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/scan",
        "header": [],
        "body": {
          "mode": "formdata",
          "formdata": [
            {
              "key": "file",
              "type": "file",
              "src": []
            },
            {
              "key": "job_offer",
              "value": "Offre test",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "response": []
    }
  ]
}